WEBVTT

00:00:01.820 --> 00:00:05.000
WRITTEN BY HYUGA NATSU

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:15.500
THE APOTHECARY DARIES

00:01:29.280 --> 00:01:30.970
THE APOTHECARY DARIES

00:01:33.890 --> 00:01:34.930
Lady Gyokuyou,

00:01:35.010 --> 00:01:38.310
what do you mean Maomao hasn’t come back?

00:01:35.240 --> 00:01:38.230
‎THIS STORY IS A FICTION AND ALL NAMES OF FIGURES AND ORGANIZATIONS ARE FICTITIOUS.
MOREOVER, THE STORY HAS NO RELATION TO REAL-LIFE INCIDENTS AND EVENTS.

00:01:38.390 --> 00:01:40.350
From the look of it,

00:01:40.380 --> 00:01:44.390
Episode 41: The Fox Village

00:01:40.430 --> 00:01:43.560
it seems like you didn’t sneak her out.

00:01:43.650 --> 00:01:45.060
I would not do that.

00:01:46.020 --> 00:01:49.360
Has she gotten herself involved
in something troublesome again?

00:01:50.320 --> 00:01:53.820
Hongniang, when did you last see her?

00:01:54.410 --> 00:01:56.910
She was here yesterday during the day.

00:01:57.450 --> 00:01:59.450
She was apparently preparing mugwort

00:01:59.540 --> 00:02:01.830
for Lady Gyokuyou in the medical office.

00:02:02.790 --> 00:02:05.710
At that time,
they apparently discussed making a notice

00:02:05.790 --> 00:02:07.500
to post in the rear palace.

00:02:07.590 --> 00:02:09.210
After that,

00:02:09.300 --> 00:02:11.840
she went to the study hall.

00:02:11.920 --> 00:02:13.800
I searched everywhere

00:02:13.880 --> 00:02:15.720
she might have gone,

00:02:15.800 --> 00:02:17.640
but I couldn’t find her.

00:02:19.470 --> 00:02:21.980
She may act impulsively sometimes,

00:02:22.060 --> 00:02:23.890
but she knows abandoning her post

00:02:23.980 --> 00:02:27.730
as Lady Gyokuyou's attendant
would lead to punishment.

00:02:28.480 --> 00:02:30.690
Unless… she can’t return.

00:02:30.780 --> 00:02:33.820
Or perhaps she got caught up in something.

00:02:33.900 --> 00:02:36.320
Did she make any enemies?

00:02:36.410 --> 00:02:38.030
If it's enemies,

00:02:38.120 --> 00:02:40.540
she most likely made them here and there.

00:02:46.460 --> 00:02:48.130
Even Maomao

00:02:48.210 --> 00:02:51.210
wouldn’t stand a chance
if she was ganged up on.

00:02:51.300 --> 00:02:53.130
Yes. However…

00:02:53.920 --> 00:02:56.380
Xiaomao wouldn’t go down so easily

00:02:56.470 --> 00:02:58.340
without taking someone down with her.

00:03:00.970 --> 00:03:03.100
If she stays gone with no explanation,

00:03:03.180 --> 00:03:05.350
we’ll have no choice but to punish her.

00:03:05.440 --> 00:03:09.190
But before that, we must find her.

00:03:10.650 --> 00:03:11.570
Excuse me.

00:03:12.610 --> 00:03:14.570
Oh, Lord Jinshi, I was just preparing tea…

00:03:14.650 --> 00:03:15.530
No need.

00:03:16.280 --> 00:03:17.820
Rather, I have questions for you.

00:03:18.410 --> 00:03:20.240
About Maomao, right?

00:03:20.330 --> 00:03:24.370
Yes. Tell me everything that happened
before she vanished.

00:03:25.460 --> 00:03:26.580
Yes.

00:03:28.920 --> 00:03:30.420
That’s all I know.

00:03:31.590 --> 00:03:33.380
She made mugwort in the medical office,

00:03:33.460 --> 00:03:35.880
then went to the study hall.

00:03:36.720 --> 00:03:40.010
I can't get more than what I already heard
at the Jade Palace.

00:03:44.140 --> 00:03:47.140
Now that I think about it,
is Maomao not around today?

00:03:47.230 --> 00:03:48.650
MAOMAO

00:03:48.730 --> 00:03:52.650
Speaking of her,
when the young lady left here,

00:03:52.730 --> 00:03:54.480
she was oddly clingy.

00:03:59.450 --> 00:04:01.030
What was she like?

00:04:02.200 --> 00:04:05.910
I think it was when
you went to the toilet, Mr. Luomen.

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:08.410
She was a bit too clingy
for just being playful.

00:04:08.500 --> 00:04:11.500
I think it was
after she took out some medicine

00:04:11.580 --> 00:04:13.750
that helps with fatigue.

00:04:26.270 --> 00:04:28.520
What's wrong, Mr. Luomen?

00:04:30.100 --> 00:04:32.690
Is this what she took?

00:04:35.070 --> 00:04:37.490
I don’t remember that well,

00:04:37.570 --> 00:04:40.660
but I feel like there used to be more.

00:04:42.160 --> 00:04:43.950
I’m sorry,

00:04:44.030 --> 00:04:46.660
but may I go look for her?

00:04:47.540 --> 00:04:48.710
Do you know where she is?

00:04:48.790 --> 00:04:52.170
No, I mean the cat Maomao.

00:04:52.250 --> 00:04:54.670
Though I might find the girl too.

00:05:02.090 --> 00:05:04.800
How will finding the cat help?

00:05:05.390 --> 00:05:06.640
I don't know…

00:05:13.190 --> 00:05:16.020
It’s a new medicine, strong in aroma,

00:05:16.110 --> 00:05:17.610
and very effective.

00:05:19.650 --> 00:05:24.530
Maomao, where are you? Meow!

00:05:25.740 --> 00:05:27.740
Let’s pretend we didn’t hear that.

00:05:28.910 --> 00:05:30.910
A cat’s range

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:33.500
isn't usually that extensive.

00:05:33.580 --> 00:05:35.960
Lord Jinshi, we’ve found her.

00:05:36.040 --> 00:05:38.380
-Where?
-In the thickets on the north side.

00:05:40.720 --> 00:05:44.340
She’s either sleeping… or drunk.

00:05:47.390 --> 00:05:48.680
These berries…

00:05:49.180 --> 00:05:52.230
They match the ones I brought earlier.

00:05:53.060 --> 00:05:55.230
There’s also this, and…

00:05:55.310 --> 00:05:56.480
Paper?

00:06:00.320 --> 00:06:01.940
There’s nothing written on it…

00:06:02.030 --> 00:06:05.450
Maomao probably left it.

00:06:05.530 --> 00:06:08.280
But if it’s blank,
what was she trying to say?

00:06:08.370 --> 00:06:11.660
We might understand
if we return to the medical office.

00:06:13.330 --> 00:06:15.750
He won't say anything until there's proof.

00:06:16.630 --> 00:06:18.920
So Maomao took after
her adoptive father, huh?

00:06:20.510 --> 00:06:23.590
This may look like a blank piece of paper,

00:06:23.670 --> 00:06:27.390
but she used to enjoy
this little game as a child.

00:06:30.680 --> 00:06:31.640
The writing…

00:06:32.140 --> 00:06:35.100
If you write on paper using juice or tea,

00:06:35.190 --> 00:06:39.320
only that part burns more easily
when it's heated.

00:06:40.530 --> 00:06:43.110
This time, she used alcohol.

00:06:44.200 --> 00:06:47.870
Ah, now that you mention it,
she did take a few bottles of alcohol.

00:06:48.620 --> 00:06:50.870
You could’ve said that first.

00:06:50.950 --> 00:06:55.210
Why was the cat Maomao sleeping there?

00:06:55.750 --> 00:06:57.750
This is called catnip.

00:06:57.830 --> 00:06:59.540
When brewed into tea,

00:06:59.630 --> 00:07:02.760
it helps relieve poor circulation
and fatigue.

00:07:02.840 --> 00:07:06.760
Cats love it. It makes them act drunk.

00:07:06.840 --> 00:07:09.140
She likely used the cat as a marker,

00:07:09.220 --> 00:07:11.350
and used it.

00:07:11.430 --> 00:07:13.850
Although the odds of finding it are low,

00:07:13.930 --> 00:07:17.650
she probably hoped Luomen would notice.

00:07:18.650 --> 00:07:21.190
One character is "shrine,"

00:07:21.940 --> 00:07:23.940
but I can’t read the other one.

00:07:24.530 --> 00:07:27.530
Is there a shrine near that area?

00:07:27.610 --> 00:07:31.200
There’s an old building
north of the rear palace.

00:07:31.280 --> 00:07:32.120
Let's send someone.

00:07:33.240 --> 00:07:34.870
The other character…

00:07:34.950 --> 00:07:38.920
What is it? It looks hastily scribbled,
like there wasn’t time.

00:07:40.290 --> 00:07:42.840
Was she in a desperate situation?

00:07:45.800 --> 00:07:47.180
Well, who knows?

00:07:48.430 --> 00:07:49.930
Aren’t you worried?

00:07:50.010 --> 00:07:52.760
I'm worried. However…

00:07:52.850 --> 00:07:56.350
all I can do is what I’m able to do.

00:07:56.430 --> 00:08:00.150
I can’t let this
interfere with my other duties.

00:08:00.230 --> 00:08:03.860
Plus, she was out of contact

00:08:03.940 --> 00:08:05.400
for nearly a year once before.

00:08:07.860 --> 00:08:10.240
Right after she was taken,

00:08:10.320 --> 00:08:12.240
she couldn’t even reach her family

00:08:12.330 --> 00:08:14.870
and just worked silently as a maid.

00:08:17.250 --> 00:08:19.920
These two are similar…

00:08:21.170 --> 00:08:24.250
I will do the same. I’ll do what I can.

00:08:24.920 --> 00:08:26.170
Excuse me.

00:08:36.810 --> 00:08:37.890
Lord Jinshi!

00:08:48.360 --> 00:08:50.150
I must carry myself as a noble.

00:08:50.860 --> 00:08:52.240
I will do what I can.

00:08:53.200 --> 00:08:55.120
Right now, as a eunuch,

00:08:55.620 --> 00:08:57.580
my duty is to track Maomao down.

00:08:59.460 --> 00:09:01.370
It's messy handwriting…

00:09:01.460 --> 00:09:04.790
More than messy. it looks rushed,

00:09:04.880 --> 00:09:07.380
as if she couldn’t write properly.

00:09:07.960 --> 00:09:10.130
It sort of looks like
the character for "wing."

00:09:10.220 --> 00:09:13.220
But the lower part is quite neat.

00:09:13.930 --> 00:09:16.760
Mao Mao’s writing has a quirk to it.

00:09:17.640 --> 00:09:19.020
Everyone, take a look.

00:09:19.640 --> 00:09:21.980
Isn't this the character for "next"?

00:09:23.150 --> 00:09:25.270
It’s similar, but something feels off.

00:09:25.360 --> 00:09:27.780
Yeah, there are more strokes.

00:09:27.860 --> 00:09:30.900
I agree, Sister.

00:09:30.990 --> 00:09:32.910
What do you think, Seki-u?

00:09:34.240 --> 00:09:37.540
Doesn’t it look like
the character for "green"?

00:09:37.620 --> 00:09:40.620
Look here. It looks warped
but it’s actually straight.

00:09:40.710 --> 00:09:44.460
You're right. Green because this is
the Jade Palace?

00:09:44.540 --> 00:09:46.340
I wonder what she meant by it.

00:09:47.340 --> 00:09:48.880
Shisui.

00:09:52.340 --> 00:09:53.550
Who’s that?

00:09:54.760 --> 00:09:58.760
Um, it’s the name of a maid
who’s often seen with Maomao.

00:09:58.850 --> 00:09:59.930
She’s called Shisui…

00:10:00.770 --> 00:10:02.060
A name, huh…

00:10:02.560 --> 00:10:05.940
There’s another maid
whose name also includes "Sui."

00:10:06.610 --> 00:10:09.610
There’s also one called Shaoran,

00:10:09.690 --> 00:10:11.360
and they often hung out together.

00:10:11.440 --> 00:10:14.280
I’ve met that maid a few times.

00:10:14.360 --> 00:10:16.910
But the other one vanished…

00:10:19.620 --> 00:10:21.080
Find the maid named Shisui.

00:10:21.160 --> 00:10:22.120
Yes!

00:10:25.290 --> 00:10:26.250
Lord Jinshi.

00:10:45.520 --> 00:10:47.650
We’re drifting.…

00:10:48.270 --> 00:10:50.070
I wonder where we’re headed.

00:10:50.150 --> 00:10:51.480
Who knows?

00:10:57.490 --> 00:11:00.370
If you want to save this girl, obey.

00:11:01.240 --> 00:11:04.620
Back then, I had no choice
but to follow Suirei.

00:11:04.710 --> 00:11:08.290
If I had refused, both Shisui and I
would’ve been in danger.

00:11:09.540 --> 00:11:12.130
I wasn't tempted by
the medicine to revive the dead.

00:11:12.210 --> 00:11:13.460
Huh? What?

00:11:13.550 --> 00:11:17.430
Still, who knew there was such
a hidden passage in the rear palace?

00:11:20.350 --> 00:11:22.720
Don’t even think of calling for help.

00:11:24.730 --> 00:11:25.890
This place…

00:11:26.560 --> 00:11:29.190
is near where I first met Shisui.

00:11:29.270 --> 00:11:32.780
-Shenlü, keep watch.
-Yes.

00:11:44.250 --> 00:11:46.250
All right. Let’s go.

00:11:48.000 --> 00:11:51.380
I hope my father realizes what’s going on.

00:11:59.680 --> 00:12:02.100
A carriage is waiting outside.

00:12:02.680 --> 00:12:06.480
From here on, you’ll play the part
of a village girl who has been sold off.

00:12:06.560 --> 00:12:09.150
Change clothes there,
and we’ll head to the port.

00:12:13.980 --> 00:12:18.070
When I changed,
the alcohol was discovered.

00:12:18.150 --> 00:12:20.110
The only thing I managed to keep on me

00:12:20.200 --> 00:12:23.620
was the hairpin Lord Jinshi gave me.

00:12:25.950 --> 00:12:29.830
Should I make plans to escape with Shisui?

00:12:30.710 --> 00:12:31.790
No.

00:12:36.010 --> 00:12:38.420
-You'll go to sleep?
-Yeah.

00:12:39.470 --> 00:12:40.380
Me too.

00:12:44.310 --> 00:12:47.350
She’s usually so loud and cheerful,
like a kid.

00:12:54.860 --> 00:12:57.400
Good night, Maomao.

00:12:58.400 --> 00:13:00.650
Good night, Shisui.

00:13:12.790 --> 00:13:14.880
We'll walk a bit further now.

00:13:20.050 --> 00:13:22.380
We had to switch boats twice.

00:13:22.470 --> 00:13:24.600
We were on the river…

00:13:25.300 --> 00:13:27.470
Are these guys the guards?

00:13:28.470 --> 00:13:29.930
Something’s off.

00:13:30.020 --> 00:13:33.520
When we were on the boat,
I thought we were heading north,

00:13:33.600 --> 00:13:35.770
but this forest

00:13:35.860 --> 00:13:37.730
is warm and humid.

00:13:38.730 --> 00:13:41.240
Where could this be?

00:13:41.320 --> 00:13:44.160
I wonder if there are
any unusual plants growing here.

00:13:52.290 --> 00:13:53.870
What was that?

00:13:54.460 --> 00:13:57.380
A snake? Afraid of snakes?

00:13:58.590 --> 00:14:00.630
That’s not so strange.

00:14:01.220 --> 00:14:02.800
What is strange is…

00:14:23.110 --> 00:14:25.450
It's okay. They're not here anymore.

00:14:28.950 --> 00:14:30.290
This is bad.

00:14:33.080 --> 00:14:35.960
Slowly breathe in… and out.

00:14:36.040 --> 00:14:38.170
Hey, you!

00:14:39.040 --> 00:14:40.420
This confirms it.

00:14:43.550 --> 00:14:45.720
What are you trying to pull?

00:14:46.300 --> 00:14:47.720
Just some petty harassment.

00:14:47.800 --> 00:14:50.430
It didn’t seem like that was all…

00:14:53.270 --> 00:14:56.940
Suirei, you knew Shisui
before this, didn’t you?

00:14:59.020 --> 00:15:00.980
What are you talking about?

00:15:01.070 --> 00:15:05.820
Shisui seems far more educated
than she looks.

00:15:06.490 --> 00:15:09.990
And her manners here and there
gave away her privileged upbringing.

00:15:10.080 --> 00:15:11.080
A bug!

00:15:11.160 --> 00:15:14.200
Although it's true
that she didn’t always act that way.

00:15:14.790 --> 00:15:17.420
There are plenty of maids like that.

00:15:17.500 --> 00:15:21.090
After all, even the strategist
has a daughter.

00:15:21.170 --> 00:15:24.300
Seems like they've looked into me too…

00:15:24.380 --> 00:15:25.630
Shisui,

00:15:25.720 --> 00:15:29.350
you must’ve been shocked when that kitten
appeared from the secret passage.

00:15:32.100 --> 00:15:34.100
You panicked and chased her,

00:15:34.180 --> 00:15:36.190
only to be seen by someone.

00:15:42.980 --> 00:15:47.110
Maomao, you are sharp.
That's why you set me up, huh?

00:15:47.200 --> 00:15:48.490
But don't do that again.

00:15:48.570 --> 00:15:50.870
My older sister hates snakes.

00:15:51.450 --> 00:15:53.830
Didn’t I say the name was too obvious?

00:15:53.910 --> 00:15:56.710
The others didn’t catch on though.

00:15:58.420 --> 00:16:02.210
Suirei and Shisui
only differ by one character.

00:16:02.290 --> 00:16:04.510
Most maids can’t read,

00:16:04.590 --> 00:16:06.590
so they didn’t notice.

00:16:07.090 --> 00:16:10.140
But that solves one mystery.

00:16:10.720 --> 00:16:13.510
How did Maomao get in?

00:16:13.600 --> 00:16:17.770
Shisui was visiting
the bath around that time.

00:16:17.850 --> 00:16:20.850
Probably to help her get in contact with
Suirei more easily while she

00:16:20.940 --> 00:16:23.400
worked as a eunuch, transporting water.

00:16:24.780 --> 00:16:26.400
Maybe I’ve failed as a spy.

00:16:27.490 --> 00:16:31.660
Why did these two take me
away from the rear palace?

00:16:32.450 --> 00:16:35.660
Maybe to use me to check on that guy?

00:16:36.540 --> 00:16:39.460
If so, nothing good will come of it.

00:16:39.540 --> 00:16:40.370
Let’s go.

00:16:43.710 --> 00:16:46.800
I guess running will be useless
after coming this far.

00:16:49.840 --> 00:16:53.010
There’s one more thing
I haven’t confirmed.

00:16:53.680 --> 00:16:54.930
I’m not sure, but…

00:16:55.680 --> 00:16:57.180
Could it be… Shisui is…?

00:17:23.580 --> 00:17:24.460
We've arrived.

00:17:49.320 --> 00:17:52.610
There's a village out here?

00:18:05.040 --> 00:18:06.920
-Hot springs?
-Yeah.

00:18:07.000 --> 00:18:09.960
Otherwise, who’d build a village here?

00:18:10.590 --> 00:18:13.340
No wonder it’s so humid and warm.

00:18:19.060 --> 00:18:22.060
Are those foreigners?

00:18:22.850 --> 00:18:24.560
That paper ornament…

00:18:25.480 --> 00:18:27.820
The envoy during the moon spirit.

00:18:28.770 --> 00:18:30.610
No… It couldn’t be.

00:18:34.360 --> 00:18:37.570
Watch where you’re going!
Don’t just stand there like an idiot!

00:18:40.040 --> 00:18:41.370
If this was the pleasure district,

00:18:41.450 --> 00:18:44.540
I'd knock this brat out!

00:18:44.620 --> 00:18:45.460
-Hey!
-Ouch!

00:18:45.540 --> 00:18:48.750
You weren’t looking either, Kyou-u.

00:18:48.840 --> 00:18:50.300
Sis!

00:18:51.170 --> 00:18:53.800
Wait, it’s big sis Suirei!

00:18:53.880 --> 00:18:55.430
What’s with the outfit?

00:18:55.510 --> 00:18:57.220
It really suits you!

00:18:57.300 --> 00:18:58.300
Shut it.

00:18:59.180 --> 00:19:00.810
They're acquaintances?

00:19:00.890 --> 00:19:02.220
I heard

00:19:02.310 --> 00:19:05.270
I’d never see you two again…

00:19:05.350 --> 00:19:07.270
Guess nanny was lying, huh?

00:19:07.940 --> 00:19:11.360
Nanny, huh? Typical rich brat.

00:19:11.440 --> 00:19:14.950
Oh! Is it the festival?
So that’s why you’re back!

00:19:15.030 --> 00:19:16.320
It starts tomorrow!

00:19:16.410 --> 00:19:19.580
Yeah. Hard to believe we made it in time.

00:19:20.280 --> 00:19:21.950
Did you prepare a festival lantern?

00:19:22.040 --> 00:19:24.620
We just got back.

00:19:24.710 --> 00:19:26.170
Hope there’s something good left.

00:19:26.250 --> 00:19:28.540
Let’s check! This way, come on!

00:19:38.550 --> 00:19:42.810
Is this an inn? Quite a fancy building.

00:19:46.980 --> 00:19:51.400
That’s one of the guards
who took the envoy.

00:19:54.650 --> 00:19:57.200
Wondering why a special envoy is here,
are you?

00:19:57.280 --> 00:19:59.530
You know they were an envoy?

00:20:00.160 --> 00:20:03.410
Even after coming back to life,
I’ve had all kinds of work.

00:20:05.750 --> 00:20:08.170
No rest for the dead.

00:20:13.170 --> 00:20:16.130
Sis! Over here!

00:20:18.010 --> 00:20:19.470
Let's go, Maomao!

00:20:27.850 --> 00:20:29.650
Young Master, we found it!

00:20:30.270 --> 00:20:32.270
Is this good enough?

00:20:33.820 --> 00:20:35.110
That’s probably enough.

00:20:38.860 --> 00:20:40.610
What a nice lantern plant!

00:20:41.370 --> 00:20:42.660
Nice, right?

00:20:42.740 --> 00:20:45.620
You like it, so I made sure to find it.

00:20:45.700 --> 00:20:48.620
No, didn't the maid find it?

00:20:49.370 --> 00:20:50.420
Thanks.

00:20:51.040 --> 00:20:53.750
But you're not the one
who collected this, right Kyou-u?

00:21:04.300 --> 00:21:07.310
-Thanks.
-You’re welcome.

00:21:09.810 --> 00:21:11.520
Nicely done!

00:21:11.600 --> 00:21:13.770
Ow! Ow!

00:21:13.860 --> 00:21:16.940
-So he can be honest sometimes, huh.
-It hurts, sis!

00:21:17.030 --> 00:21:18.110
-I'll call you a brat,
-Quit it!

00:21:18.190 --> 00:21:19.950
instead of a "damned brat."

00:21:21.570 --> 00:21:23.490
So the festival, huh?

00:21:24.160 --> 00:21:27.120
How long has it been
since we left the rear palace?

00:21:29.200 --> 00:21:31.830
Lord Jinshi, the report is submitted.

00:21:32.620 --> 00:21:35.130
Near the thicket where we found the paper,

00:21:35.210 --> 00:21:37.090
we discovered an old shrine.

00:21:37.670 --> 00:21:39.340
It seems she used it as an entry point.

00:21:39.420 --> 00:21:42.300
and escaped through an abandoned waterway.

00:21:42.380 --> 00:21:46.390
Then Maomao made it
outside the rear palace?

00:21:46.470 --> 00:21:48.020
Possibly.

00:21:48.100 --> 00:21:51.890
Also, since the day Xiaomao disappeared,

00:21:51.980 --> 00:21:55.520
a new eunuch has gone missing too.

00:21:56.020 --> 00:21:58.900
And as for the maid named Shisui,

00:21:59.400 --> 00:22:00.940
we did not find her in the registry.

00:22:01.030 --> 00:22:02.780
She’s not registered?

00:22:02.860 --> 00:22:05.950
No. They say no such maid ever existed.

00:22:08.160 --> 00:22:10.620
Lord Jinshi! Lady Gyokuyou…

00:23:46.000 --> 00:24:00.950
NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW

00:23:57.950 --> 00:24:00.930
Next episode: The Lantern Plant
